ed":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"T1 — post ingest  (sync-social-posts)\n────────\n1.  Extract URLs from caption, run through\n     extractMerchantUrl + detectDesignation to\n     get retailer + external_id.\n2.  Call Omni (affiliate.com) for each URL/ASIN;\n     collect product.brand strings.\n3.  INSERT social_post_mention rows:\n        ('external_id', <id>, retailer)\n        ('brand_name',  <normalized brand>)\n4.  Resolve-now lookup: any matching\n     account / retailer_product → INSERT\n     social_post_brand row.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"T1 — post ingest  (sync-social-posts)\n────────\n1.  Extract URLs from caption, run through\n     extractMerchantUrl + detectDesignation to\n     get retailer + external_id.\n2.  Call Omni (affiliate.com) for each URL/ASIN;\n     collect product.brand strings.\n3.  INSERT social_post_mention rows:\n        ('external_id', <id>, retailer)\n        ('brand_name',  <normalized brand>)\n4.  Resolve-now lookup: any matching\n     account / retailer_product → INSERT\n     social_post_brand row.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"t2_box","type":"rectangle","x":640,"y":770,"width":500,"height":220,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#fff3bf","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"c1","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":34,"version":1,"versionNonce":34,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"t2_text","type":"text","x":660,"y":786,"width":460,"height":190,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"c2","roundness":null,"seed":35,"version":1,"versionNonce":35,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"T2 — brand onboards  (setAccountIdentity /\n                       createAccount)\n────────\nWhen account.brand_name is set or changed:\n\n  SELECT social_post_id FROM\n         social_post_mention\n   WHERE mention_type = 'brand_name'\n     AND mention_value =\n         normalize(account.brand_name)\n\n  → INSERT social_post_brand rows for each.\n\nHistorical posts that mentioned this brand\nbefore it existed on Boost link up now.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"T2 — brand onboards  (setAccountIdentity /\n                       createAccount)\n────────\nWhen account.brand_name is set or changed:\n\n  SELECT social_post_id FROM\n         social_post_mention\n   WHERE mention_type = 'brand_name'\n     AND mention_value =\n         normalize(account.brand_name)\n\n  → INSERT social_post_brand rows for each.\n\nHistorical posts that mentioned this brand\nbefore it existed on Boost link up now.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"t3_box","type":"rectangle","x":1180,"y":770,"width":500,"height":220,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#e7f5ff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"c3","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":36,"version":1,"versionNonce":36,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"t3_text","type":"text","x":1200,"y":786,"width":460,"height":190,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"c4","roundness":null,"seed":37,"version":1,"versionNonce":37,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"T3 — catalog sync  (importProducts /\n                    affiliate-product-sync)\n────────\nWhen a new retailer_product row is written:\n\n  SELECT social_post_id FROM\n         social_post_mention\n   WHERE mention_type = 'external_id'\n     AND mention_value = rp.external_id\n     AND source_retailer = sa.retailer\n\n  → walk rp → product → account\n  → INSERT social_post_brand rows.\n\nHistorical posts that linked to ASINs /\nWalmart items now resolve.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"T3 — catalog sync  (importProducts /\n                    affiliate-product-sync)\n────────\nWhen a new retailer_product row is written:\n\n  SELECT social_post_id FROM\n         social_post_mention\n   WHERE mention_type = 'external_id'\n     AND mention_value = rp.external_id\n     AND source_retailer = sa.retailer\n\n  → walk rp → product → account\n  → INSERT social_post_brand rows.\n\nHistorical posts that linked to ASINs /\nWalmart items now resolve.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"invariant_title","type":"text","x":100,"y":1030,"width":1000,"height":30,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"c5","roundness":null,"seed":38,"version":1,"versionNonce":38,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"How the \"brand joins Boost later\" case works","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"How the \"brand joins Boost later\" case works","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"invariant_text","type":"text","x":100,"y":1080,"width":1580,"height":280,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"c6","roundness":null,"seed":39,"version":1,"versionNonce":39,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"• At T1, if no account / retailer_product matches, no social_post_brand row is written — but the social_post_mention rows persist.\n  Omni's brand-name guess and the extracted ASIN / Walmart id live on, even if the brand doesn't exist on Boost yet.\n\n• T2 and T3 are the backfill triggers. Whichever event happens LAST for a given (post, brand) pair is what creates the link:\n     - brand onboards first → T2 fires when Amazon catalog is later imported (T3) \n     - post arrives first → T2 when the brand sets brand_name, T3 when they run Amazon/affiliate sync.\n\n• Captions are NEVER re-parsed and Omni is NEVER re-called for historical posts. All backfill is a single indexed join:\n     social_post_mention (type, value)  ↔  account.brand_name_normalized  or  retailer_product.external_id\n\n• social_post_brand has unique PK (social_post_id, brand_account_id) + ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING, so duplicate triggers are safe no-ops.\n\n• Mention rows that never resolve (brand never joins Boost) sit dormant forever. ~100 bytes each, indexed, no query cost unless a matching write happens.","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"• At T1, if no account / retailer_product matches, no social_post_brand row is written — but the social_post_mention rows persist.\n  Omni's brand-name guess and the extracted ASIN / Walmart id live on, even if the brand doesn't exist on Boost yet.\n\n• T2 and T3 are the backfill triggers. Whichever event happens LAST for a given (post, brand) pair is what creates the link:\n     - brand onboards first → T2 fires when Amazon catalog is later imported (T3) \n     - post arrives first → T2 when the brand sets brand_name, T3 when they run Amazon/affiliate sync.\n\n• Captions are NEVER re-parsed and Omni is NEVER re-called for historical posts. All backfill is a single indexed join:\n     social_post_mention (type, value)  ↔  account.brand_name_normalized  or  retailer_product.external_id\n\n• social_post_brand has unique PK (social_post_id, brand_account_id) + ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING, so duplicate triggers are safe no-ops.\n\n• Mention rows that never resolve (brand never joins Boost) sit dormant forever. ~100 bytes each, indexed, no query cost unless a matching write happens.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25}],"appState":{"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff","lockedMultiSelections":{}},"files":{}}